WTF/
Logs/
logs/
Screenshots/
Errors/
Cache/
Config.wtf
config-cache.wtf
bindings-cache.wtf
layout-local.txt
chat-cache.txt
WoWCombatLog*.txt
SavedVariables/
*.dmp
*.mdmp

# Images — only synthetic, metadata-stripped docs mock-ups and test fixtures
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.tga
!docs/img/**
!tests/fixtures/**

